# Zack Fair: "attach AN Equipment that was attached to Zack Fair to that creature" - one, not each. Skullclamp and Basilisk Collar are both
# attached to Zack as he is sacrificed; Bot1 chooses the Collar, which is attached to the Ornithopter (1/3 with the counter, deathtouch and lifelink),
# while Skullclamp, the other, stays on the battlefield unattached (it was unattached when he left, CR 704.5n). Skullclamp
# still draws two for the death of the creature it equipped. Hand: nothing left of the opening seven, the Ornithopter drawn and cast, 2 drawn by Skullclamp.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Zack Fair
Skullclamp
Basilisk Collar
Ornithopter
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x16

